during this time D changes values many many times. That is not really the best

00:11:56.210 --> 00:12:06.650
thing ever that we that we want to do. We want to have the time within in which we

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:15.850
quote-unquote sample the input input value be as small as possible. Now there

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:22.730
couple of things that we can do. We can try to make this clock cycle tiny, tiny, tiny, tiny. Did you

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:37.000
decide for tiny? Which is still pretty big. The better option is what we want to do. We want to

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:44.600
allow that on only one edge of the clock, and we are going to take positive edge of the clock,

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:51.000
or rising edge of the clock, we want to sample the value of the input and capture it inside.

